1
00:00:01,014 --> 00:00:04,895
It's not an offside, ref!
Fuck!

2
00:00:07,879 --> 00:00:09,796
-Beto...
-What?

3
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,624
-I want to tell you something.
-Wait till it ends.

4
00:00:12,658 --> 00:00:14,982
No, Cruz Azul will lose.
You know that.

5
00:00:15,517 --> 00:00:18,415
-It's important, man.
-Tell me.

6
00:00:20,937 --> 00:00:22,232
Your breath stinks.

7
00:00:23,238 --> 00:00:25,810
-What?
-That's it. Your breath stinks.

8
00:00:25,844 --> 00:00:29,007
Your breath is rotten,
like you used poop mouthwash.

9
00:00:30,621 --> 00:00:34,193
-Right now?
-Yes. And always. Always.

10
00:00:34,227 --> 00:00:37,950
Your mouth has always smelled
like an abandoned fishery.

11
00:00:37,984 --> 00:00:40,879
You know?
A full bus in the summer.

12
00:00:40,913 --> 00:00:42,484
A morgue with no energy.

13
00:00:47,396 --> 00:00:51,854
-I don't feel anything.
-C'mon! You're used to it.

14
00:00:51,888 --> 00:00:54,815
If your mouth was the groin
of a dead crook,

15
00:00:54,849 --> 00:00:56,435
it would smell better.

16
00:00:56,469 --> 00:01:00,301
Your saliva is like that liquid
that comes from organic trash.

17
00:01:00,335 --> 00:01:01,896
What if I brush my teeth?

18
00:01:01,930 --> 00:01:04,585
Only if you use
turpentine and thinner.

19
00:01:05,773 --> 00:01:07,873
You need professional help,
Beto.

20
00:01:07,907 --> 00:01:11,630
-A dentist?
-No... An exorcist.

21
00:01:12,367 --> 00:01:14,190
Why didn't you tell me
before?

22
00:01:14,224 --> 00:01:18,577
Because every time I try,
I feel like my face will melt!

23
00:01:18,611 --> 00:01:21,832
I can talk facing forward
because I have sinusitis,

24
00:01:21,866 --> 00:01:25,029
but my eyes are burning.

25
00:01:25,293 --> 00:01:26,865
Does everyone know?

26
00:01:27,282 --> 00:01:29,378
I think they don't
in Australia.

27
00:01:30,412 --> 00:01:34,154
We do this because we love you
and want to help you.

28
00:01:36,834 --> 00:01:38,453
-Goal!
-Goal!

29
00:01:38,487 --> 00:01:42,101
-What a goal!
-Celebrate in silence!

30
00:01:47,344 --> 00:01:50,406
-Fuck!
-Fuck off, man!

31
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,105
That's a bad move, man.

32
00:01:52,139 --> 00:01:54,294
-What a goal!
-Fuck!

33
00:01:54,540 --> 00:01:55,741
That's bad, man.